Verification: 138 small controls (48 witness, 90 exhausted), including 63/64/65 and 127/128/129 candidate boundaries, matched the pinned Python DFS's exact witness and both counters; explicit subset enumeration also agreed. The same controls passed ASan/UBSan. The standalone exporter below produces byte-identical graph input to the reviewed Python preparation for both incumbents. Source reviewed for ordering, union budget, mask intersections and timeout propagation. These are computational exclusions, not formal proof certificates.

